    "summary": "Tier-1 bootstrap for the hiqlite fork's specification corpus. Defines what a spec is here: the authored versus derived boundary, spec identity, the typed authority graph, determinism, and the refusal rule. Fixes the ownership boundary against OpenRaft and against external state-machine callers, states what evidence and lifecycle words mean, and records the explicit, bounded adoption scope of the pilot. Owns the local regeneration, validation, and pull-request coupling workflow, and the tier-2 and tier-3 governance documents under standards/spec.\n",
